OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I'm donating 100 pints of my
OL,4,Abreast milk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma's son Bert was born in November
OL,7,F2025 at the Princess Royal Hospital in
OL,8,FTelford with Down's syndrome and
OL,9,Foesophageal atrisia, a birth defect
OL,10,Fwhich means food can't reach the
OL,11,Fstomach.
OL,13,FAt three weeks old, he contracted
OL,14,Fsepsis. He spent 16 weeks in intensive
OL,15,Fcare at Birmingham Children's Hospital,
OL,16,Funable to drink his mother's milk.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35102
SC,0002
