PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1790746022
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I'm donating 100 pints of my
OL,4,Abreast milk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn those difficult moments, Emma made a
OL,7,Fdecision. "I sat there thinking I'm
OL,8,Fgoing to have a lot of milk to give
OL,9,Faway. I saw a number of mothers that
OL,10,Freally struggled to express milk. I
OL,11,Fthought, let's donate mine to other
OL,12,Fneonatal babies."
OL,14,FEmma has since donated more than 90
OL,15,Fpints of breast milk to the Human Milk
OL,16,FBank at Birmingham Women's Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
